  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity to Carry Out Sunstainable Rural Development (Centered on local government officials and village leaders who carry out rural development)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.1: Local Government Officials Equipped with Advanced Governance SkillsOutput 1.2: Village Leaders  with Enhanced Leadership and Management SkillsOutput 1.3: BARD Trainers Equipped with Advanced Skills and ResourcesOutput 2.1: Development and Implementation of a Self-Sustaining Community Development Action Plan (In collaboration with Local Government)Output 2.2: Empowerment and Support for Community-Led Development Initiatives (By Individual Communities or Cooperative Groups)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen local governance and empower communities in rural areas to achieve sustainable development. By collaborating with local governments based on the Korean Saemaul Undong model and supporting community-driven initiatives, the project seeks to enhance service delivery and foster self-reliant communities.&#xbc29;&#xae00;&#xb77c;&#xb370;&#xc2dc; &#xb18d;&#xcd0c;&#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4; &#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc8fc;&#xbbfc;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xc99d;&#xb300; &#xbc0f; &#xb18d;&#xcd0c; &#xacf5;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4; &#xd65c;&#xc131;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xbe48;&#xace4; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
  </description>
